            <ArticleTitle>Atypical Initiation of Typical Atrioventricular Node Reentry Tachycardia With a Ventricular Couplet.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>936-937</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S0002-9149(16)31099-2</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.amjcard.2016.06.028</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In a woman with sinus rhythm a couplet of ventricular premature complexes is followed by a retrograde P wave. A subsequent couplet of ventricular premature complexes is followed by typical atrioventricular nodal reentrant tachycardia.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2016 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
